+# JeRyu Web Forge
+
+Run the Rust API and static web app:
+
+```bash
+npm run web:build
+cargo run -p jeryu -- serve --bind 127.0.0.1:8787 --frontend-dir apps/web/dist
+```
+
+Run frontend dev mode:
+
+```bash
+cargo run -p jeryu -- serve --bind 127.0.0.1:8787 --no-static --dev-cors
+npm run web:dev
+```
+
+JeRyu Web is the browser forge for repositories, code browsing, README rendering, merge requests, review, settings, CI, agents, audit, and realtime activity. All mutations must use the action preview and execution API.
